# Exceptions to scripts/release/check-binary-paths.sh.
#
# One line per exception: a FIXED STRING, a TAB, and a one-line justification.
# A string the guard reports that contains the fixed string is excused. A line
# without a justification is an error. Remapping the path is almost always the
# right fix instead (scripts/release/env.sh, scripts/install-openfhe.sh).
#
# No exceptions at the moment.
